            <ArticleTitle>Weight Loss: A Patient and Physician's Perspective.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1049-53</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1007/s12325-016-0334-5</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article, co-authored by a patient affected by obesity and an obesity medicine specialist, discusses the patient's experience of living with the disease and using many different weight loss approaches until finding a lifestyle program that was appropriate for her metabolism. The physician discusses the scientific basis of insulin resistance, and why the chosen lifestyle program worked so well for this individual.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
